f=\"https://www.youtube.com/theonyxpath\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.youtube.com/theonyxpath</a></li> <li><b>Facebook</b>: <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/TheOnyxPath\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.facebook.com/TheOnyxPath</a></li> <li><b>Twitch</b>: <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/theonyxpath\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.twitch.tv/theonyxpath</a></li> </ul> </div> </div> </div>Thank you for spending time with us on the forums, and we hope you'll continue your discussions with us elsewhere.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude1e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}